VEC0503 Heat and ice cream is a cause, Carl. Sales jump the same afternoon the heat does.
VEC0504 Ice cream and crime: common cause. The heat pushes both. Ice cream is innocent.
VEC0505 Ice cream doesn't cause crime. Hot weather pushes both up. If we say that on air, the vans will hear it.
VEC0506 Paradiso and the lottery: coincidence. More tickets, more winners. No magic.
VEC0507 Paradiso isn't lucky. They buy nine thousand tickets. Of course they win more.
VEC0508 The full moon: can't tell. One month of Rex's chart. Nobody can say from that.
VEC0509 One month of data from Rex. Honestly, we can't tell either way.
VEC0601 Radio Free Fierro broadcasts from a van on Missionary Hill. Of course it does.
VEC0602 Well, well. The scientists came. Welcome to the truth, gentlemen. You're live.
VEC0603 Thanks, Rex. You're right that these things go up together. We checked.
VEC0604 Ha! You hear that, San Fierro? Connected!
VEC0605 Some of them because one causes the other. Heat sells ice cream.
VEC0606 Some because something else drives both. Heat pushes up ice cream and arguments at the same time.
VEC0607 And some are just numbers bumping into each other. Paradiso buys more tickets, so it wins more.
VEC0608 And the full moon?
VEC0609 One month of your chart. Nobody can tell from that. Including you.
VEC0610 ...Hot weather. Huh.
VEC0611 So what you're saying is, the weather controls us all.
VEC0612 That's... not what he said.
VEC0613 Lines are open, people!
VEC0651 Breaking news, San Fierro! Vers3Dynamics confirms it: ice cream causes crime!
VEC0652 That's not... we didn't... Carl. Look outside.
VEC0653 ~y~ICE CREAM VAN:~w~ Hey! You the guys who said ice cream causes crime?!
VEC0654 Drive. Drive now.
VEC0655 I think we lost them. And the ice cream union's goodwill.
VEC0701 Four links. A cause, a common cause, a coincidence and a shrug. That's a good night's science.
VEC0702 Next time we say 'common cause' slower. And louder. Near fewer ice cream vans.
VEC0703 Man, that radio guy's gonna be talking about weather control for a year.
VEC0704 Probably. But a few thousand people heard the difference between a cause and a coincidence tonight. That's not nothing.
VEC0705 ~y~SFTV NEWS:~w~ Radio Free Fierro drew record ratings last night with an unusually calm debate about ice cream.
VEC0706 ~y~SFTV NEWS:~w~ Ice cream vans protested outside a Doherty laboratory last night over remarks on pirate radio. No ice cream was harmed.
VEC0707 Carl. Tomorrow we open the doors. Everything, in public. Ready?
VEC0708 Ready for what?
VEC0709 The open experiment.
